# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day30

## Question 1

If I _____ more time, I would join the program.

A. have
B. had
C. will have
D. having

Answer: B

→ 현재 사실과 반대되는 가정
→ If + 과거형

---

## Question 2

If the company had invested earlier, it _____ more profit.

A. would make
B. will make
C. would have made
D. makes

Answer: C

→ 과거 사실과 반대되는 가정
→ would have + p.p.

---

## Question 3

If I _____ you, I would accept the offer.

A. am
B. was
C. were
D. be

Answer: C

→ If I were you

---

## Question 4

If she had prepared better, she _____ the presentation.

A. would improve
B. would have improved
C. will improve
D. improves

Answer: B

---

## Challenge

If the company _____ a more efficient system, it would reduce costs.

A. implements
B. implemented
C. had implemented
D. implementing

Answer: B

---

## Key Point

### 현재 사실 반대

If + 과거형
→ would + V

### 과거 사실 반대

If + had + p.p.
→ would have + p.p.

### 자주 나오는 표현

If I were you, ...

→ 내가 너라면 ...
